[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 1382.63, "timestamp": "00:23:02", "text": "你最近没有为此付费。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1384.87, "timestamp": "00:23:04", "text": "呃，多目标实现之类的东西，呃，这算什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1387.95, "timestamp": "00:23:07", "text": "比铰刀便宜的称为万向节"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1391.75, "timestamp": "00:23:11", "text": "实验室。只要4美元。我当时想，“好吧，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1395.75, "timestamp": "00:23:15", "text": "三个平台，4美元。我会做的。”我曾"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1397.75, "timestamp": "00:23:17", "text": "我以前做过这件事，当时我就想，“好吧，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1400.83, "timestamp": "00:23:20", "text": "我选这个。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1404.47, "timestamp": "00:23:24", "text": "我明白了。所以，它看起来像你的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1406.47, "timestamp": "00:23:26", "text": "随着提示音，嘴巴也动了动。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1408.75, "timestamp": "00:23:28", "text": "所以，看起来就像你真的说过话一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1412.07, "timestamp": "00:23:32", "text": "电话。糟糕，我不知道"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1414.149, "timestamp": "00:23:34", "text": "印度文化，但在美国，我们却拿它开玩笑"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1416.31, "timestamp": "00:23:36", "text": "互相嘲笑，以此取乐。一切都好"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1417.909, "timestamp": "00:23:37", "text": "乐趣。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1418.75, "timestamp": "00:23:38", "text": "我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1422.63, "timestamp": "00:23:42", "text": "看。这就是美国的情况。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1427.07, "timestamp": "00:23:47", "text": "真想知道那是什么感觉。不用担心。嗯，但是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1429.63, "timestamp": "00:23:49", "text": "哦。哇。那是谁？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1435.23, "timestamp": "00:23:55", "text": "呃，三、五、六和八都很大。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1437.51, "timestamp": "00:23:57", "text": "数字。中国元素或精神"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1439.35, "timestamp": "00:23:59", "text": "信仰。是的。避免使用数字4，因为它"}]